WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
The customer asks for an auto quote. The You step is active. The assistant offers barcode scanning or manual entry, with a privacy note.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
The stepper advances to Your car. A confirmation card lets the customer review details, continue, or edit the information.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
The assistant presents three cards for coverage priorities. The customer chooses More protection.

00:20.000 --> 00:28.000
The stepper advances to Your quote. The customer can review options or talk to an agent.
